      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `a31a22b2415c9e7945b9f62a7af8f8c39e0c98ea944b6a635540c1580b8c53b7--experimental-data-victims-of-family-and-domestic-violence.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ed6631b56d27e4ee98b2539344f9c31d411beeec1f55440dc4bf74a60db15c0e | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 4a8582f093884e9dc4a508b5ad9bba13070a9bd3a5cf0b79b24f1d2dfe2ef0cb | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | eba34b6d4b1abbab7d1a093329f48e122cbbf550f2ac5c1d83ce1694955f41db | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 68d7335323c1ee48b73f2229f790fd04c3f4477e055665cc60e70fb5ce3a0269 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 637f9dc4be486ff557c4b51c5c5a0ab9e1b8e128833dec46a06a1a3544fb569e | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 2bb73853fc012eb6cdad5c6fba8d6ad9539253a78bb2d50c93ea39d2348a4e64 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | eae9663bf9225e7acfaf65d8bbfb83618d13f948d3285916726b57e72118e687 | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 5816549cf00d6a34dfc91cf38097437f8c249f57b794db46afe8de4c16d76284 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
